WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.930
Dhalsim begins with standing and crouching light punches.

2
00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:01.630
After cancel Drive Rush, crouching light punch keeps the sequence going.

3
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:02.230
Back medium punch connects before heavy Yoga Blast.

4
00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:02.880
Heavy Yoga Blast launches the opponent.

5
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.230
Crouching medium punch catches the falling opponent.

6
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:04.430
Light Yoga Fire reaches the opponent after the juggle and is blocked.
